  "constructionChanges": [
    "Annular lower hall roof around a supported occupied upper storey, real upper floor/balcony/rail, sealed cut boarding and timbers.",
    "Source-sized whole pagoda, shorter recessed windows, four-sided balcony bands and solid finial discs.",
    "Projecting hall capitals, enclosed recessed door/shrine/cabinet and corresponding figure/lotus/pedestal contact.",
    "56 detailed foreground stone parts with independent pits/chips, real grit joint beds, narrower fitted iron drain and actual-height cupped fallen leaves.",
    "Closed single-volume column receiver with blind circular socket at the real black shoe datum.",
    "Terrain-borne forest stems, six supported lateral crowns, rooted understory and upper-right near maple; winding rain walk benched into the hill.",
    "Whole CC0 botanical variants and connected curved leaf components retaining original PBR atlas UVs, topology and normals.",
    "Complete512px actual-scene probe, physical lantern flux, finite existing paper-bay radiance and water-IOR impact relief.",
    "Low opening camera looks toward the temple and pulls to the unchanged photographic end camera."
  ],
  "remainingDominantMismatches": [
    "Hall joinery and carved bearing mass remain orderly and simplified compared with HD10.",
    "Distant pine silhouettes are sparse/needle-like and the hill retains excessive exposed ground.",
    "Stone lantern forms, paving joint rhythm and rain-highlight scale still differ; weathering is not photo-equivalent.",
    "Native warm bounce, reflected light contrast and the recessed entrance still fall short of the photograph."
  ],
